  "type": "module",
  "description": "Agent Client Protocol, layer 1: the protocol types against refs/acp/schema.v1.json, the JSON-RPC 2.0 codec, and the client session lifecycle. NO spawn, NO gi://, NO dependencies — the transport is an injected interface, so every byte of protocol lives here and is unit-testable on both runtimes.",
